## 7. Documentation governance

Canonical: `framework/rules/documentation-governance.md`; project values:
`project-context/docs-policy.md`; artifact lifecycles:
`framework/rules/doc-artifact-registry.md`.

- Every agent is a worker by default; workers never write documentation — their only channel is
  appending to {{docs.worker_channel}}.
- {{docs.sole_writer}} is the sole doc writer, inside the whitelist that
  `project-context/docs-policy.md` holds; `CLAUDE.md` only on explicit human instruction.
